{"strongs": "H0422", "word": "אָלָה", "translit": "a.lah", "root": "אלה", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "swear, curse", "definition": "II. אָלָה verb swear, curse (compare I. אלה ? so Thes Lag Or ii. 3 ) — Qal Perfect 1Kgs 8:31 ( = 2Chr 6:22 all Vrss Th Bö Bä Kp reading וְאָלָה ); אָלִית Judg 17:2 Infinitive absolute אָלֹה Hos 4:2 אָלוֺת Hos 10:4 . 1. swear, take oath before God 1Kgs 8:31 ( = 2Chr 6:22 ); in covenants Hos 4:2 ; Hos 10:4 (falsely). 2. curse Judg 17:2 . Hiph`il Imperfect וַיּאֶֹל 1Sam 14:24 Infinitive לְהַאֲלֹתוֺ 1Kgs 8:31 = 2Chr 6:22 adjure, put under oath.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB471')\">BDB471</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H422')\">H422</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB470')\">BDB470</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB472')\">BDB472</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>אָלָה</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>swear, curse</highlightword> (compare I. <bdbheb>אלה</bdbheb> ? so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>Or ii. 3</sup></lookup>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:31\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,31)\">1Kgs 8:31</ref> ( = <ref ref=\"2Chr 6:22\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(14,6,22)\">2Chr 6:22</ref> all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vrss')\"><reflink>Vrss</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('The')\">Th</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bö')\">Bö</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bä')\">Bä</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kirkp')\">Kp</lookup> reading <bdbheb>וְאָלָה</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>אָלִית</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 17:2\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(7,17,2)\">Judg 17:2</ref> <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>אָלֹה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 4:2\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"2\